                  "text": "Rearrange pH = –log[H<sup>+</sup>] to [H<sup>+</sup>] = 10<sup>–pH</sup>. With pH 2.90, [H<sup>+</sup>] = 10<sup>–2.90</sup> = 1.26 × 10<sup>–3</sup> mol dm<sup>–3</sup>.",
